    "title": "Road Surface (U-Net)",
    "description": "A U-Net with a ResNet34 encoder that segments roads in very high resolution RGB aerial and satellite imagery and returns the road surface as polygons. The road probability maps of a request are mosaicked, thresholded, vectorised, simplified and filtered by area. Trained on SpaceNet 3 roads (Khartoum, Paris) and fine-tuned on OpenAerialMap drone imagery with OpenStreetMap highways (Maputo, Freetown, Dar es Salaam). Fine-tunable on any road surface polygon dataset.",
    "mlm:name": "unet-roads",
    "mlm:architecture": "U-Net (ResNet34 encoder)",
    "mlm:tasks": [
      "semantic-segmentation"
    ],
    "mlm:framework": "PyTorch",
    "mlm:framework_version": "2.14.1",
    "mlm:pretrained": true,
    "mlm:pretrained_source": "SpaceNet 3 roads (Khartoum, Paris), then OpenStreetMap highways over OpenAerialMap drone imagery (Maputo, Freetown, Dar es Salaam); ImageNet encoder",
    "fair:recommended_zoom": 19,
    "fair:preview": {
